From: Armbian Lenovo ECG-AR70P Port <armbian@localhost>
Subject: [PATCH] mfd/rk808: add missing rk808-regulator and rk808-rtc platform IDs

In Rockchip Linux 6.12, rk808_regulator_driver and rk808_rtc_driver define
non-NULL .id_table (rk8xx_regulator_id_table and rk8xx_rtc_id_table) listing
rk805/rk809/rk816/rk817/rk818 but omitting rk808-regulator and rk808-rtc.
Because platform_match() does not fall back to driver.name when id_table is
present, RK808 PMIC child devices never bind to their regulator or RTC drivers.

Add the missing "rk808-regulator" and "rk808-rtc" entries to both tables.
---
 drivers/regulator/rk808-regulator.c | 1 +
 drivers/rtc/rtc-rk808.c             | 1 +
 2 files changed, 2 insertions(+)

diff --git a/drivers/regulator/rk808-regulator.c b/drivers/regulator/rk808-regulator.c
index 111111111111..222222222222 100644
--- a/drivers/regulator/rk808-regulator.c
+++ b/drivers/regulator/rk808-regulator.c
@@ -1774,6 +1774,7 @@ static int rk808_regulator_probe(struct platform_device *pdev)
 
 static const struct platform_device_id rk8xx_regulator_id_table[] = {
 	{ "rk805-regulator", 0 },
+	{ "rk808-regulator", 0 },
 	{ "rk809-regulator", 0 },
 	{ "rk816-regulator", 0 },
 	{ "rk817-regulator", 0 },
diff --git a/drivers/rtc/rtc-rk808.c b/drivers/rtc/rtc-rk808.c
index 111111111111..222222222222 100644
--- a/drivers/rtc/rtc-rk808.c
+++ b/drivers/rtc/rtc-rk808.c
@@ -485,6 +485,7 @@ static int rk808_rtc_probe(struct platform_device *pdev)
 
 static const struct platform_device_id rk8xx_rtc_id_table[] = {
 	{ "rk805-rtc", 0 },
+	{ "rk808-rtc", 0 },
 	{ "rk809-rtc", 0 },
 	{ "rk816-rtc", 0 },
 	{ "rk817-rtc", 0 },
